      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay fine but i really dont think it's that bad. i've had weird throat feelings before when i'm just stressed or have acid reflux. if i take a couple of extra benadryl and maybe an antacid like pepcid, wouldn't that cover all bases? i'm way too tired to deal with an ambulance right now, i just want to be able to sleep. can't i just monitor it for an hour and see if it gets better?",
